WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.059 --> 00:00:06.197
Roxy watched the dragon's cube float to the middle of the stadium.

2
00:00:06.198 --> 00:00:10.741
"This fighter came to us by accident," the Battle Master said.

3
00:00:10.742 --> 00:00:14.047
"We don't know its name or where it's from.

4
00:00:14.048 --> 00:00:17.658
But its claws are sharp, and its breath—"

5
00:00:17.659 --> 00:00:22.472
Roar! The dragon shot flames into the air.

6
00:00:22.473 --> 00:00:24.307
The crowd screamed.

7
00:00:24.308 --> 00:00:29.104
Nebulon dropped his shield. He quickly picked it up.

8
00:00:29.105 --> 00:00:35.343
"I'm a g-great warrior!" he said. "I'm not afraid of—"

9
00:00:35.344 --> 00:00:38.084
Fwoosh! Flames shot toward him.

10
00:00:38.085 --> 00:00:41.243
"Ahh!" Nebulon ran.

11
00:00:41.244 --> 00:00:48.263
Roxy watched the dragon chase Nebulon all over the stadium.

12
00:00:48.264 --> 00:00:50.941
Wukong laughed.

13
00:00:50.942 --> 00:00:55.871
"Why is that guy so afraid? It's just a fire-breathing dragon."

14
00:00:55.872 --> 00:00:58.810
"That dragon is really powerful."

15
00:00:58.811 --> 00:01:02.102
Cozlin told him what happened on Delkor.

16
00:01:02.103 --> 00:01:05.287
"That sounds pretty bad," Wukong said.

17
00:01:05.288 --> 00:01:07.651
"So the dragon's from Delkor?"

18
00:01:07.652 --> 00:01:10.150
"Nope." Roxy frowned.

19
00:01:10.151 --> 00:01:13.563
"Kid Comet left out a big part of the story."

20
00:01:13.564 --> 00:01:17.045
She told Wukong about the door in the mountain and the gold.

21
00:01:17.046 --> 00:01:22.676
Cozlin rolled her eyes. "You make it sound like this is all my fault!"

22
00:01:22.677 --> 00:01:27.189
Roxy groaned. "It is all your fault!"

23
00:01:27.190 --> 00:01:29.104
Nebulon tripped and fell.

24
00:01:29.105 --> 00:01:33.009
The dragon blasted fire as the warrior hid under his shield.

25
00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:40.031
Cozlin shook her head. "Nebulon should probably surrender."

26
00:01:40.032 --> 00:01:42.182
"Yep," Wukong said.

27
00:01:42.183 --> 00:01:45.083
"And we should probably talk to that dragon."

28
00:01:45.084 --> 00:01:48.759
Cozlin raised an eyebrow. "Talk to it?"

29
00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:53.076
Wukong shrugged. "Why not? Maybe it can help us."

30
00:01:53.077 --> 00:01:56.410
"I surrender!" Nebulon shouted.

31
00:01:56.411 --> 00:02:00.286
Roxy listened as the Battle Master announced the next battle.

32
00:02:00.287 --> 00:02:02.084
She heard the name Surina.

33
00:02:02.085 --> 00:02:05.926
But after that she stopped listening because her cube was moving.

34
00:02:05.927 --> 00:02:10.453
Roxy gulped. "It's my turn to battle!"

35
00:02:10.454 --> 00:02:14.624
Her friends cheered. "Go, Rocket Girl!"

36
00:02:14.625 --> 00:02:18.399
All around her, aliens in the crowd clapped and shouted.

37
00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:21.396
A moment later her cube was gone.

38
00:02:21.397 --> 00:02:24.912
She was on the stadium's floor, facing a robed figure.

39
00:02:24.913 --> 00:02:27.874
"That must be Surina," Roxy thought.

40
00:02:27.875 --> 00:02:32.883
"Hopefully this battle isn't too . . . Whoa! What just happened?"

41
00:02:32.884 --> 00:02:34.729
The stadium seemed to be gone.

42
00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:39.180
Roxy now saw a strange forest, filled with alien trees.

43
00:02:39.181 --> 00:02:41.196
She looked back at Surina.

44
00:02:41.197 --> 00:02:43.419
"Hmm," Roxy thought.

45
00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:49.626
"Surina has the power to create illusions. Well, I have powers too!"

46
00:02:49.627 --> 00:02:52.729
Zoom! Roxy flew toward Surina.

47
00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:55.806
But before she reached her, Surina vanished.

48
00:02:55.807 --> 00:02:57.540
Roxy spun around.

49
00:02:57.541 --> 00:03:00.381
Now the fighter was on the other side of the forest.

50
00:03:00.382 --> 00:03:05.030
Roxy flew toward her again. Zoom!

51
00:03:05.031 --> 00:03:07.996
Suddenly a giant creature burst out of the ground!

52
00:03:07.997 --> 00:03:13.518
"Whoa!" Roxy turned fast and flew straight into Surina's fist. Pow!

53
00:03:13.519 --> 00:03:16.559
Roxy tumbled backward.

54
00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:21.359
She sat up. The creature was gone.

55
00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:24.124
"It wasn't real," Roxy thought.

56
00:03:24.125 --> 00:03:27.546
Then she spotted Surina peeking out from behind a tree.

57
00:03:27.547 --> 00:03:32.029
Roxy jumped up and fired her eye laser beams. Whiz-hoo!

58
00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:36.315
Surina vanished and reappeared in a different spot.

59
00:03:36.316 --> 00:03:39.521
Roxy fired again. Whiz-hoo!

60
00:03:39.522 --> 00:03:41.422
But again she missed.

61
00:03:41.423 --> 00:03:45.406
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired again and again.

62
00:03:45.407 --> 00:03:47.137
Surina grabbed her arm.

63
00:03:47.138 --> 00:03:51.321
Zoom! She dragged Roxy high into the air.

64
00:03:51.322 --> 00:03:54.319
Roxy blew her freeze breath. Whoosh!

65
00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:58.025
Surina's eyes went wide as ice formed around her.

66
00:03:58.026 --> 00:04:03.989
Her teeth chattered. "I s-surrender!"

67
00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:06.505
The forest disappeared.

68
00:04:06.506 --> 00:04:11.546
The audience cheered. "Rocket Girl! Rocket Girl!"

69
00:04:11.547 --> 00:04:16.279
Back in her cube, Roxy paced back and forth as the crowd cheered.

70
00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:20.871
"Who cares about a stupid fight?" she thought. "I need to—"

71
00:04:20.872 --> 00:04:24.922
Zoop! Her cube started to drop!

